# vulkan-present on the board's desktop (vulkan-present(8)): the same program as boot-venus's, an app of the desktop
# image where tier 1 is built, started by `compose-test desktop` (or `echo start vulkan-present >/svc/launcher/ctl`)
# once Radharc is up: a swapchain on the native Mali driver, presented to a window of the Radharc on the display.
service vulkan-present
program vulkan-present
app vulkan-present
use windows
mount /dev devmgr/dev
